# eOn SVN r2549. HarnessCounter through ext_pot. Kernel ljcluster.
# Lowest mode of the 200 LJ38 geometries, same protocol as eon/develop-low-lj38-lanczos. Saddle Search max_iterations is 0. Lanczos tolerance is 0 and quit_early is false. The harness raises Lanczos max_iterations from 1 and keeps the first run whose absolute overlap is at least 0.99. Potential ljcluster. direction.dat is the numpy seed 314159 mode. Main random_seed is 1. The run swaps the potential for ext_pot. The harness kernel is the develop kernel for this potential name. The 2014 table used r2156. The binary is SVN r2549, the registry pin. Export of the 2014 revision is forbidden, so this row is r2549.
counter harness
code Eon svn
code_version r2549
commit r2549
algorithm Lanczos
tuning default
template eon-svn/low-lj38-lanczos
problem lowest-eigenvector/lj38
reducer harness
cap 10000
n 200
par2_mean 26.385
nfailed 0
mean_calls 26.385
median_calls 25.0
min_calls 13.0
max_calls 63.0
n_crash 0
n_divergence 0
n_cap 0
n_wrong_stationary 0
